                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL D'AFFICHAGE ET APPAREIL DE CALCUL LE COMPRENANT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DISPLAY APPARATUS AND COMPUTING APPARATUS INCLUDING THE SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed are a display apparatus and a computing apparatus including the same, which vibrate a display module to output sound. The display apparatus includes a display module including a display panel configured to display an image, a vibration plate on a rear surface of the display module, a connection member between the rear surface of the display module and the vibration plate, a vibration module on the vibration plate, and an enclosure between the rear surface of the display module and the vibration plate, the enclosure being spaced apart from the vibration module to surround the vibration module.</p>
            </abstract>
